This standalone packaging changes listing publisher/support/privacy metadata
and release wording, recalculates the manifest digest, and adds repository
documentation. The app program, tool declaration, app icon and native listing
screenshots are unchanged. See review/PROVENANCE.json.

The required OctoSense host supplies the Rinx-derived MarkdownEditor; neither
its native binary nor Rinx's source/icons/fonts are bundled here as runtime
assets. The screenshots depict that editor with fictional notes. Rinx article
components are pinned by the host at 4b89097d8791a7190d01de1c576979c93df0013d.
Rinx code is Apache-2.0; inherited Robrix portions retain MIT attribution. The
host's icon collection has mixed upstream asset terms: Apache-2.0 is not a
blanket relicensing of icons visible in screenshots. Preserve the host's
upstream notices when distributing that host.

